### Register (only needed once)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login (send this first)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get my profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create project
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "My First Project",
  "description": "Testing Tovo"
}

### List projects
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create task (change the 1 if your project id differs)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Write requirements",
  "priority": "high",
  "due_date": "2026-12-01"
}

### List tasks, filtered
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/1/tasks?priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Move task to in progress (change the 1 if your task id differs)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}